             <string>&lt;html&gt;&lt;head/&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-style:italic; color:#ff0000;&quot;&gt;*Note:&lt;/span&gt; The file is hashed on this machine and is never uploaded. Only the digest is published, in an OP_RETURN output. This costs a normal transaction fee; the 0.01 INN it moves is paid back to this wallet. Verify a stamp later with the &lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:600;&quot;&gt;podverify&lt;/span&gt; console command. Verifying by file path needs -enablefilerpc=1; verifying by SHA-256 digest needs no flag.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
